    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Dumb Witchfinder - an exciting roguelike platformer game with pixel art graphics. Your task is to survive in a deep forest full of nimble little demons. These creatures will try to stop you, and you need to dodge their attacks and strike back to kill them all. The further you go into the forest, the more demons you will encounter.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe pleasant pixel graphics and unobtrusive color palette create a cozy game atmosphere. The intuitive gameplay and simple controls allow you to dive right into the game without long introductions or learning the rules.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKill enemies to progress through the levels and earn coins. Coins can be spent on upgrades to become faster, stronger, and more resilient, and to defeat all the demons.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Pixel art graphics and pleasant color palette<br />\r\n    Intuitive gameplay and simple controls<br />\r\n    Exciting roguelike platformer<br />\r\n    Character upgrade system<br />\r\n    Engaging levels with increasing difficulty",
